    "detailed_description": "<br><br>Drifting Kings is Stylized Arcade offline/online Drifting/Touge/Gymkhana  racing game with a colorful and stylized environments. fun to play ,hard to master.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934700/extras/739c48a70efb0b5879d6079ae1a98188.webp?t=1704322599\" /></div><br>The Art Of Driving Sideways<br>Challenge Ai and Online Friend in Various track in more than 14 Tracks including the most famous Track compound Ebisu(Kita, nishi, Touge, Higashi, Minami).<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934700/extras/7f3af94c0436fbcdfcfaf2b74db9adb2.webp?t=1704322599\" /></div><br><br>Drive throw Snaking downhill terrain in the ultimate test of man and machine<br>in more than 6 locations inspired by japan mountains roads(Fuji, Akagi, Myogi, and more)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934700/extras/bca60eb09cccba98a505638e183abbc1.webp?t=1704322599\" /></div><br><br>Maneuver through the course Layout As Fast as Possible in the ultimate gymkhana play ground.<br>more than 30 Challenging course Layout Its you and your machine against time drive fast and avoid hitting the obstacle ,But remember to memorize the Layout<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934700/extras/cee72c16d05f257d0d6d457f573bfd91.webp?t=1704322599\" /></div><br><br>Each mode has its own cars Find the best car for your need.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934700/extras/9ff00a2132fef616d554ae491bfbe562.webp?t=1704322599\" /></div><br><br>Show off your virtual photography Skills with the Photo mode .<br><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenge the AI in the Single Player Career mode Drift/Touge and collect all points.</li><li>Challenge your self in Single Player Career gymkhana mode and collect all points and beat other players on the leaderboard.</li></ul><br><br><strong>The game has controller and wheel support and allows to manually change the button mapping in-game.</strong>",
